#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:2
msgid "AWS Route53"
msgstr "AWS Route53"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| integrates directly with Amazon Route 53 to automatically create "
"DNS entries for Instances provisioned to a configured Cloud or Group. "
"|morpheus| also syncs in Route 53 Domains for easy selection while "
"provisioning, or setting as the default Domain on a Cloud or Network."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| integrates directly con Amazon Route 53 to automáticamente create"
" DNS entries para Instances provisioned to un configurado Cloud o Group. "
"|morpheus| también syncs in Route 53 Domains para easy selection mientras "
"provisioning, o setting as el predeterminado Domain on un Cloud o Network."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:10
msgid "Add Route 53 Integration"
msgstr "Add Route 53 Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:12
msgid ""
"Route 53 can be added in the `Administration` or `Infrastructure` sections:"
msgstr ""
"Route 53 se puede agregar in el `Administration` o `Infrastructure` "
"sections:"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:14
msgid "In |AdmInt|, select :guilabel:`+ New Integration`"
msgstr "In |AdmInt|, select :guilabel:`+ New Integración`"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:15
msgid ""
"In ``Infrastructure > Networks > Services``, select :guilabel:`Add Service`"
msgstr ""
"In ``Infrastructure > Networks > Services``, select :guilabel:`Agregar "
"Service`"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:16
msgid "Provide the following:"
msgstr "Proporcione el following:"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:18
msgid "TYPE"
msgstr "TYPE"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:19
msgid "Route 53"
msgstr "Route 53"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:20
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:21
msgid "Name for the Integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Name para el Integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:22
msgid "REGION"
msgstr "REGION"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:23
msgid "AWS Region for the Integration"
msgstr "AWS Region para el Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:24
msgid "ACCESS KEY"
msgstr "ACCESS KEY"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:25
msgid "AWS User IAM Access Key"
msgstr "AWS User IAM Access Key"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:27
msgid "SECRET KEY"
msgstr "SECRET KEY"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:27
msgid "AWS User IAM Secret Key"
msgstr "AWS User IAM Secret Key"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:29
msgid ""
"Once saved the Integration will be added and visible in both |AdmInt| and "
"``Infrastructure > Networks > Services``"
msgstr ""
"Once saved el Integration será be agregado y visible in both |AdmInt| y "
"``Infrastructure > Networks > Services``"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:31
msgid "All fields can be edited after saving."
msgstr "All campos puede be edited después de saving."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:34
msgid "Domains"
msgstr "Domains"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:36
msgid ""
"Once the integration is added, Route 53 Domains will sync and listed under "
"``Infrastructure > Networks > Domains``."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que la integración está agregado, Route 53 Domains será sync y "
"listed under ``Infrastructure > Networks > Domains``."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:38
msgid ""
"Default Domains can be set on Networks and Clouds, and can be selected when "
"provisioning. Additional configuration options are available by editing a "
"domain in `Networks > Domains`"
msgstr ""
"Default Domains se puede establecer on Networks y Clouds, y puede be "
"seleccionado cuando provisioning. Additional configuración opciones son "
"disponible by editing un domain in `Networks > Domains`"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:41
msgid "Configuring Route 53 with Clouds and Groups"
msgstr "Configurar Route 53 with Clouds and Groups"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:43
msgid ""
"DNS Integrations are available in the `DNS Integration` dropdown in Cloud "
"and Group settings."
msgstr ""
"DNS Integrations son disponible in el `DNS Integration` desplegable in Cloud"
" y Group configuración."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:45
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will register Instances with the DNS provider when provisioned "
"into a Cloud or Group with a DNS Integration added."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| será register Instances con el DNS proveedor cuando provisioned "
"en un Cloud o Group con un DNS Integration agregado."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:48
msgid "Add DNS Integration to a Cloud"
msgstr "Add DNS Integration to un Cloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:50
msgid "In ``Infrastructure > Clouds`` edit the target Cloud."
msgstr "In ``Infrastructure > Clouds`` edit el destino Cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:51
#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:60
msgid "Expand the `Advanced Options` section."
msgstr "Expand el `Advanced Options` sección."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:52
#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the `DNS Integration` dropdown, select an available DNS Integration."
msgstr ""
"En el `DNS Integration` desplegable, select un disponible DNS Integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:53
#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:62
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Save Changes"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:56
msgid "Add DNS Integration to a Group"
msgstr "Add DNS Integration to un Group"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:58
msgid "In ``Infrastructure > Groups`` select the target Group."
msgstr "In ``Infrastructure > Groups`` select el destino Group."

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:59
msgid "Select the `Edit` button for the Group"
msgstr "Seleccione el `Edit` botón para el Group"

#: ../../integration_guides/DNS/route53.rst:64
msgid ""
"Instances provisioned into a Cloud or Group with a DNS Integration added "
"will be registered as instancename.domain with the DNS Provider during "
"provisioning, and de-registered at teardown."
msgstr ""
"Instances provisioned en un Cloud o Group con un DNS Integration agregado "
"será be registered as instancename.domain con el DNS Provider durante "
"provisioning, y de-registered at teardown."
